#
# The tomo_tune2 art's palette in Palette role order (ADR-0019): the 8 roles
# the importer targets. The art is black, grey and white, re-indexed once by
# luminance onto the roles' order in the house default: black bg, grey muted,
# white text. The other roles are the old tomo hues the art never uses. The
# last row is the magenta stand-in for transparent (15), as in the Studio's
# .gpl download; the importer reads only the first 8 rows.
