 26  28  44	1 surface (navy)
137 137 137	2 muted (grey)
255 255 255	3 text (white)
255 205 117	4 accent (yellow)
239 125  87	5 accent2 (orange)
115 239 247	6 accent3 (cyan)
177  62  83	7 accent4 (red)
255   0 255	15 TRANSPARENT
